   "widgets_values": [
    "JEEMU AI PASS\n\n1. Load Image: pick one still (close, wide, play or late .jpg).\n2. Press Queue (Run). Result goes to ComfyUI/output as jeemu_ai_*.png.\n3. Do all four stills with the SAME settings, so they look like one room.\n\nDenoise (KSampler) is the one knob: 0.25 safe, 0.30 default, 0.35 more photo. Above 0.4 things move.\nOut of memory? Replace VAE Encode / VAE Decode with their (Tiled) versions.\n\nModels: RealVisXL_V5.0_fp16.safetensors in models/checkpoints,\ndiffusion_pytorch_model_promax.safetensors (xinsir controlnet-union-sdxl-1.0) in models/controlnet.\nDepth node needs 'ComfyUI's ControlNet Auxiliary Preprocessors' (install with Manager)."
   ],
   "title": "How to use"
  }
